sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client
  participant A as Go API
  participant O as S3/MinIO
  participant P as PostgreSQL
  participant R as Redis
  participant W as Go worker
  participant E as Embedding provider

  C->>A: POST /capture/passive or /active + JWT
  A->>A: validate claims and >=2 messages
  A->>O: PUT sessions/org/uuid.json
  alt PUT failure
    A-->>C: 503 (capture rejected)
  end
  A->>P: INSERT session processing/pending
  alt INSERT failure
    A-->>C: 503 (raw object may be orphaned)
  end
  A->>R: LPUSH synapse:session
  Note over A,R: enqueue failure is logged and recovered later
  A-->>C: 202 + sessionId

  R->>W: BRPOP removes job
  W->>P: load session attribution/object key
  W->>O: GET raw JSON
  W->>P: delete prior facts/chunks for retry
  W->>W: segment messages
  W->>E: batch embed chunks (768d)
  Note over W,E: failure degrades to keyword-only chunks
  loop chunks
    W->>P: INSERT chunk
    W->>E: batch embed heuristic facts
    W->>P: INSERT facts + UPSERT search index
  end
  W->>P: status=indexed, searchable_status=searchable
